  "body": "Owed item. The heavy gate on `main` 0aad72f88 (`cargo xtask gate heavy --base v0.25.0`, 258 steps) was stopped at the coordinator's order on 2026-11-22, because the P2 #3316 and the P1 #3319 needed the build slot.\n\n- Ended: 67 of 258 steps, all ok. This covers the release build, the kernel heavy steps, the motion heavy steps and the app heavy steps up to `area_overhead`. The #1950 known-fail tests were red as expected.\n- Interrupted: `[68] app heavy: area_picks` (no result).\n- Not run: 190 steps, the #2849 known-fail step among them. \"Not run\" is not a pass.\n- The reach includes #3310 (OBJ import, P1), whose own PR ran only 3 import heavy steps.\n\nTo do: when the build slot is free, run the rest on the main of that moment: `cargo xtask gate heavy --base v0.25.0 --only \"app heavy: area_picks\" ...` (the steps from 68 on, from `gate-logs/heavy-main-plan.txt` of worktree issue-917). Report each red step as P1. Close this issue with the run result.\n",
